TITLE Calculate Alkalinity molality for given solution conditions

SOLUTION 1
    temp      25
    pH        7.5
    units     mg/L
    Ca        100
    Alkalinity 250 as CaCO3

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file     alkalinity_calc.out
    -reset    false
    -alkalinity true
    -molalities HCO3- CO3-2 OH- H+

END
